  "review": "<h2 id=\"intro\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【神奈川県】強羅花扇　円かの杜の魅力と宿泊満足度</h2>\n\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">箱根強羅温泉の緑深き静寂の森に抱かれる「強羅花扇 円かの杜（まどかのもり）」は、神代杉の天然木と飛騨の匠の技が集結した最高峰のラグジュアリー温泉旅館です。</p>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-6\">館内全体に広がる素足に心地よい畳敷きと神代杉の香りが上質な時間へ誘い、全客室に備えられた自家源泉露天風呂と最高級飛騨牛懐石が至福の感動をお届けします。</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"hotel-card\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-6\">温泉・客室・食事・駐車場アクセス情報</h2>\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-md space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-3\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">強羅花扇　円かの杜</h3>\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.87 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/147613/147613.jpg\" alt=\"強羅花扇　円かの杜\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-stone-100\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-3 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p><strong>【都道府県】</strong> 神奈川県</p>\n      <p><strong>【エリア】</strong> 箱根</p>\n      <p><strong>【温泉・風呂】</strong> 強羅温泉の2つの自家源泉。全客室温泉露天風呂完備。大浴場「木美の湯」＆露天風呂。</p>\n      <p><strong>【駐車場】</strong> 敷地内無料駐車場完備（約20台・ドアマンお出迎え）。</p>\n      <p><strong>【お食事】</strong> 最高級「飛騨牛」のステーキやすき焼き、相模湾の新鮮地魚、極上の季節和食本格懐石料理。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F147613%2F147613.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-ext